1
00:02:26,198 --> 00:02:27,073
我迟到了!
I'm late!

2
00:02:27,740 --> 00:02:29,198
我迟到了!我迟到了!
I'm late! I'm late!

3
00:02:34,407 --> 00:02:35,490
这什么情况?
What was that?

4
00:02:37,782 --> 00:02:40,115
我起晚了 我从来不会起晚的
I overslept. I NEVER oversleep.

5
00:02:40,157 --> 00:02:42,157
但是昨天..呃啊 实在是太激动了...
But yesterday... Ugh, all the excitement....

6
00:02:42,282 --> 00:02:43,865
清醒一点 你能解决的
Get your head together, you can fix it.

7
00:02:43,948 --> 00:02:45,282
你每次都能解决
You always fix it.

8
00:02:45,323 --> 00:02:45,948
Jaune!
Jaune!

9
00:02:46,365 --> 00:02:47,698
我不能等了 我已经迟了!
I can't wait, I'm late!

10
00:02:47,740 --> 00:02:49,823
现在随时都有可能再来一个...
Any second there's going to be another....

11
00:02:50,865 --> 00:02:52,198
可恶 真准时
Damn it, right on time.

12
00:02:52,573 --> 00:02:54,115
去镇上! 我们在那会合!
Get to town! I'll meet you there!

13
00:02:55,740 --> 00:02:58,948
我睡过头的时候可不会这么生气
I'm never this upset when I oversleep.

14
00:02:59,032 --> 00:03:01,157
呃 他说的真准时是什么意思?
Uhh, what did he mean 'right on time'?

15
00:03:01,198 --> 00:03:03,157
我们下去就知道了吧
I'm sure we'll find out when we get down there.

16
00:03:03,198 --> 00:03:06,115
Ruby 你的武器呢?
Ruby, where's your weapon?

17
00:03:06,157 --> 00:03:09,323
噢噢 抱歉 我还没彻底清醒呢
Oh... sorry, still waking up

18
00:03:09,490 --> 00:03:12,490
快点 大家需要我们
Hurry, people are counting on us.

19
00:03:16,032 --> 00:03:16,115
哇哦

20
00:03:22,448 --> 00:03:24,073
谁会去用纸造房子啊?
Who makes a town out of paper?

21
00:03:24,282 --> 00:03:24,823
你好
Hello.

22
00:03:27,365 --> 00:03:28,740
欢迎来到我们的村镇
Welcome to our village.

23
00:03:28,990 --> 00:03:30,407
希望这里能讨你欢心
We hope that it pleases you.

24
00:03:30,573 --> 00:03:34,115
能不能麻烦您告诉我们 您是什么 让我们能更好的服务您呢?
Would you be so kind just to tell us what you are so that we may serve you?

25
00:03:34,657 --> 00:03:35,615
服务我们?
Serve us?

26
00:03:35,865 --> 00:03:37,448
你们镇上都起火了!
Your town is on fire!

27
00:03:37,740 --> 00:03:40,532
噢 啊 没有没有 我们很安全的
Oh, uh, no. We are quite safe.

28
00:03:40,990 --> 00:03:41,948
我们有我们的英雄
We have our hero.

29
00:03:43,740 --> 00:03:44,157
呵啊!
Hyaa!

30
00:03:49,657 --> 00:03:50,740
好耶!
Hooray!

31
00:03:50,948 --> 00:03:53,740
我们为锈迹骑士与它的大自免欢呼!
We cheer for the Rusted Knight and his white rabbit!

32
00:03:53,990 --> 00:03:54,907
好哦 好哦
Hip, hip...

33
00:03:54,573 --> 00:03:55,407
停下 停下!
Stop, stop!

34
00:03:55,615 --> 00:03:57,948
往后挪一挪 这儿到处都是水 你们会溶掉的!
Back up, there's water everywhere, you'll dissolve!

35
00:03:57,990 --> 00:04:00,448
你好啊水 我可以为您提供什么服务呢?
Hello water, how may I serve you?

36
00:04:01,073 --> 00:04:01,865
别这么做了
Stop that.

37
00:04:02,573 --> 00:04:04,990
呃 真不敢相信这里差点就毁了
Ugh, I can't believe that almost happened.

38
00:04:05,115 --> 00:04:06,990
我已经很久没有错过第一把火了
It's been ages since I missed the first fire.

39
00:04:08,615 --> 00:04:10,740
这里经常起火吗?
Do fires happen often?

40
00:04:11,032 --> 00:04:11,823
哦 每天都会
Oh, everyday.

41
00:04:12,032 --> 00:04:12,907
啥?
What?

42
00:04:14,657 --> 00:04:18,073
哦哦 呃 对哦 我想... 应该给你们介绍一下
Oh, uh, right. I guess... introductions.

43
00:04:18,407 --> 00:04:21,115
这些是讨好纸
These are the Paper Pleasers.

44
00:04:21,323 --> 00:04:25,407
他们应该是最有礼貌 最温和的仙境居民了
They are probably the most polite, most hospitable Afterans around.

45
00:04:26,573 --> 00:04:28,865
因为这就是他们的意义
Because, that's their purpose.

46
00:04:32,407 --> 00:04:35,823
在爱丽克丝把我丢下等死后Juniper去找人帮忙
When Alyx left me to die, Juniper found help.

47
00:04:36,365 --> 00:04:38,990
他带我找到了讨好纸们 让我重新站了起来
Brought me to the Paper Pleasers, who got me back on my feet.

48
00:04:39,740 --> 00:04:44,240
他们每天都在工作 不只是服务旅人 也服务他们所生活的这片土地
They work all day, not just serving travelers, but serving the land they live on, too.

49
00:04:44,698 --> 00:04:47,323
他们把这里变得更加美好 让这里成为一个祥和的地方
They beautify it, make it a place of peace.

50
00:04:48,073 --> 00:04:53,573
可惜他们有些笨拙 但这也让我更好预知他们的行动
Unfortunately they are a bit clumsy, but that also makes them predictable.

51
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:55,573
都说了让你拿着这个
Told you to hold these.

52
00:04:55,823 --> 00:04:56,907
谢谢你 勇敢的骑士
Thank you brave knight.

53
00:04:57,990 --> 00:04:58,907
Ren还是老样子
Classic Ren.

54
00:04:59,448 --> 00:05:02,532
你给他们取名字了?还是以你队友们的名字命名的?
You named them? After your teammates?

55
00:05:02,990 --> 00:05:05,698
不是 我是以所有人的名字命名的
No, I named them after everybody.

56
00:05:06,865 --> 00:05:09,115
你好 我是叫做Ruby的那一只
Hello, I am the one called Ruby.

57
00:05:09,865 --> 00:05:10,948
你们是什么?
What are you?

58
00:05:10,990 --> 00:05:12,407
令人不适了
Hate that.

59
00:05:12,740 --> 00:05:16,198
好了 麻烦的清晨灯笼燃烧的问题解决了
Okay. The disastrous lighting of the morning lantern is dealt with.

60
00:05:16,407 --> 00:05:22,657
在在平静石塔倒塌压垮寂静湖水坝淹掉整座村子之前 我们还有足够时间制定对策
That gives us just enough time to strategize before the calming pebble tower crumbles crushing the quiet pond dam, and flooding the entire village.

61
00:05:22,698 --> 00:05:25,323
所以 我们去吃个早午饭吧?
So, I'm thinking... quick brunch?

62
00:05:26,698 --> 00:05:27,740
我饿了
I could eat.

63
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:31,073
啊 我一生的心血
Ah, my life's work.

64
00:05:33,032 --> 00:05:37,823
这些年里 我和Juniper一直在系统性地探寻着附近的每一亩地
Over the years, Juniper and I had been systematically exploring as many of the nearby acres as possible.

65
00:05:38,282 --> 00:05:42,073
如果你觉得你什么都见识过了?那我告诉你 你们还差得远呢
If you think you've seen it all here? Let me tell ya, you haven't.

66
00:05:45,615 --> 00:05:48,323
你具体是在找什么?
What exactly have you been looking for?

67
00:05:49,115 --> 00:05:53,157
任何能把我们带回家的人或物
Anyone or anything that might be able to take us back home.

68
00:05:54,198 --> 00:05:58,365
好的... 那你找到什么了?
Okay... And what have you found?

69
00:05:58,615 --> 00:06:00,490
啥 到目前为止吗?没找到多少东西
What, so far? I mean, not much.

70
00:06:00,532 --> 00:06:05,073
但是最近我们找到一亩有好多金字塔的地 我对它非常非常有信心
But I've got a really REALLY good feeling about this one acre we saw with a bunch of pyramids.

71
00:06:05,198 --> 00:06:06,448
不好意思哦 呃..
Sorry, ummm....

72
00:06:07,198 --> 00:06:09,698
我只是想确认我没理解错
I'm just trying to make sure I follow.

73
00:06:10,198 --> 00:06:12,448
你找到任何线索了吗?
Do you have any leads at all?

74
00:06:12,698 --> 00:06:14,073
有什么其他计划吗?
Any other plans?

75
00:06:14,573 --> 00:06:16,365
这就是最好的计划
This is the plan.

76
00:06:17,365 --> 00:06:24,323
听着 很抱歉我没能独自解决所有的问题 但是我也不能就这么离开让它们等死
Look, I'm sorry I didn't solve all our problems by myself, but I can't just run off and let them die.

77
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:32,740
但是 需要保护村民 寻找你们 以及寻找出口 我们的时间非常的紧
But, between protecting the village, searching for you guys, and searching for an exit, we've got a really tight schedule to keep.

78
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:35,907
或者应该说 你们的时间很紧
Or rather, you've got a tight schedule to keep.

79
00:06:36,198 --> 00:06:37,573
你说什么?
I beg your pardon?

80
00:06:38,407 --> 00:06:42,407
这些是每一天这个村子都会经历的一些灾难
This is the schedule of catastrophes that befall the village everyday.

81
00:06:42,448 --> 00:06:42,573
这些是每一天这个村子都会经历的一些灾难
KEEP AWThis is the schedule of catastrophes that befall the village everyday.

82
00:06:42,740 --> 00:06:44,907
我和Jun不去阻止的话就会发生
Or, at least it would if it wasn't for me and Jun.

83
00:06:45,323 --> 00:06:47,782
有了这列表 你们可以毫无压力的拯救大家
With this, you guys can save the day, no problem.

84
00:06:47,823 --> 00:06:51,032
这样我就有更多的时间在不被打扰的情况下去寻找线索了
Which means I can go out to keep searching without any interruptions.

85
00:06:51,448 --> 00:06:56,032
有了Juniper的速度和我对这一片的熟悉程度 我们很快就能找到方法了
With Juniper's speed and my familiarity with this place, we'll find our solution in no time.

86
00:06:58,573 --> 00:07:01,073
各位这就是我们的办法了!
Guys, this is it!

87
00:07:01,323 --> 00:07:06,240
听着 这些年如果说我学到了什么 那就是有耐心真的会有回报
Look, if there is one thing I've learned after all these years, it's that patience pays off.

88
00:07:06,865 --> 00:07:08,740
是我的耐心让我们重聚了!
It's why we are finally back together!

89
00:07:08,782 --> 00:07:11,282
我会找到让我们离开的方法的 好吗?
I know I can find us a way out, okay?

90
00:07:11,865 --> 00:07:12,657
我 我知道的
I... I know it.

91
00:07:13,282 --> 00:07:14,657
我知道我可以的!
I know it!

92
00:07:16,990 --> 00:07:17,657
这不是什么疯话
This isn't crazy.

93
00:07:18,948 --> 00:07:19,657
我没疯
I'm not crazy.

94
00:07:21,323 --> 00:07:24,032
这并不疯狂 很简单的
This isn't crazy. It's easy.

95
00:07:24,532 --> 00:07:26,907
行了 在阻止石塔倒塌前我们还有时间
You know, we still got time before the pebble tower falls.

96
00:07:26,948 --> 00:07:30,365
要不这样 我 呃 我去给Juniper上鞍 然后我亲自带你们到处转转行吧?
How about I.. uh.. saddle up Juniper and show you around myself?

97
00:07:30,407 --> 00:07:32,365
让你们认识一下比较笨拙的几个小纸人
oint out some of the clumsier paper

98
00:07:33,532 --> 00:07:35,240
等你们见到尼普顿就明白了
Just wait till you guys meet Neptune.

99
00:07:37,198 --> 00:07:41,198
我的天啊Jaune 这哪是计划 这明明是个家务清单
Damn it Jaune, this isn't a plan, it's a to-do list.

100
00:07:41,407 --> 00:07:44,157
他明显经历了不少事
He's obviously been through a lot.

101
00:07:44,448 --> 00:07:47,282
是啊 现在不是心烦意乱的时候
Yeah... We can be frustrated later.

102
00:07:47,448 --> 00:07:49,407
现在Jaune需要我们
Right now, Jaune needs us.

103
00:07:49,865 --> 00:07:51,407
我们也需要他
And we still need him.

104
00:07:51,865 --> 00:07:54,323
只是我们不能完全指望他
We just can't count on him.

105
00:07:55,073 --> 00:07:56,698
那我们能指望谁?
Then who does that leave us with?

106
00:07:57,157 --> 00:08:01,323
我们明显需要有人来指条明路 不然我们可能会被丟到过去
It's obvious we need someone to guide us or we could end up thrown back in time...

107
00:08:01,490 --> 00:08:02,823
或者被树干掉
Or killed by the tree.

108
00:08:03,073 --> 00:08:03,948
或者更糟
Or worse.

109
00:08:04,157 --> 00:08:05,740
如果大家都这么...
Well if that's how everybody...

110
00:08:05,532 --> 00:08:07,198
圣树并不会杀戮
The Great Tree does not kill.

111
00:08:07,990 --> 00:08:10,073
我们一直想向他说明
That is what we keep trying to tell him.

112
00:08:10,282 --> 00:08:13,782
但我们的英雄坚信我们不会飞升
But our hero stillinsists that we never ascend.

113
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:14,740
什么?
What?

114
00:08:15,323 --> 00:08:20,698
我并不想无理 但是我们的职责已经结束了
I do not wish to be rude, but our work has been completed for quite some time.

115
00:08:20,865 --> 00:08:22,823
因为有我们 这亩地已经变得非常美丽
Because of us, the land is beautiful.

116
00:08:22,990 --> 00:08:27,865
但我们也发现了 就像我们本身一样 这里的一切也非常脆弱
But we have realized that, like ourselves, it is also very delicate.

117
00:08:28,323 --> 00:08:30,407
我们想要做能够令人喜爱的东西
We would like to make something that is pleasing.

118
00:08:30,698 --> 00:08:31,865
但也希望它们能更加坚固
But also resilient.

119
00:08:32,365 --> 00:08:36,740
所以 我们已经准备好自我 与树结合了
Because of this, we are ready to leave ourselves and merge with the tree.

120
00:08:36,990 --> 00:08:39,490
这样我们就能以新的姿态回归
So that it might return us as something new.

121
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:45,407
但是 我们的英雄并不喜欢我们这么做
But, our hero's displeased by this course of action.

122
00:08:46,198 --> 00:08:48,032
我们尝试过和大树联系
We tried reaching out to the tree.

123
00:08:48,573 --> 00:08:50,323
但我们的英雄不允许
But our hero forbade it.

124
00:08:52,157 --> 00:08:59,782
于是我们村镇最有智慧的纸人说我们可以脱离我们物理的身体 好让风将我们带到树旁
Then the wisest of our village suggested breaking from our physical forms so that winds may carry us back to the tree.

125
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:02,907
但我们的英雄非常聪明也非常勇敢
But our hero is clever and brave.

126
00:09:03,615 --> 00:09:05,198
总是让我们远离伤害
Always keeping us from harm.

127
00:09:07,073 --> 00:09:09,407
您需要明白 圣树不会杀戮
You must understand the tree does not kill.

128
00:09:09,615 --> 00:09:11,615
它只会让我们复生将我们重塑
It resurrects and rebuilds.

129
00:09:11,990 --> 00:09:14,407
我们不想让我们的英雄不高兴
We do not wish to displease our hero.

130
00:09:14,782 --> 00:09:16,615
我也希望我没有令您不愉快
And I hope I have not displeased you.

131
00:09:16,657 --> 00:09:20,657
但是 我们真的非常想回到树里
But, we so desperately wish to return to the tree.

132
00:09:20,740 --> 00:09:23,865
我们想要回家 让我们能更好地做我们该做的事
To return home so that we may carry on with our work.

133
00:09:24,615 --> 00:09:25,990
回家 是吗?
Return home, huh?

134
00:09:26,282 --> 00:09:27,782
噢 请不要难过
Oh, do not be sad.

135
00:09:28,032 --> 00:09:30,657
我们中最聪明的几位今天会去维护石塔的
The wisest are going to tackle the pebble tower today.

136
00:09:30,865 --> 00:09:32,823
这次一定会成功的
I am sure it will work this time.

137
00:09:33,115 --> 00:09:34,448
你怎么能确定?
What makes you so sure?

138
00:09:36,157 --> 00:09:36,907
没什么原因
Nothing.

139
00:09:41,365 --> 00:09:42,532
真令人悲伤
That's so sad.

140
00:09:43,365 --> 00:09:45,698
很怪 但也很悲伤
Weird, but sad.

141
00:09:46,115 --> 00:09:50,240
但是这也就说明Jaune对于树的了解并不一定都正确
But it also means Jaune might not be totally right about the tree

142
00:09:50,698 --> 00:09:53,698
树不代表死亡 而是重生
It's not death, it's rebirth.

143
00:09:54,282 --> 00:09:56,365
从某些角度上看来 是这样
From a certain perspective, maybe.

144
00:09:56,490 --> 00:09:59,282
但是那样的话路易斯到底怎么了呢?
But, what happened to Lewis then?

145
00:09:59,865 --> 00:10:00,448
Jaune说..
Jaune said...

146
00:10:00,490 --> 00:10:01,782
Jaune当时不在场
Jaune wasn't there.

147
00:10:02,198 --> 00:10:03,782
甚至连猫都不在场
The cat wasn't even there.

148
00:10:04,073 --> 00:10:08,657
没有任何一个人知道完整的故事 要是留下来给村民做保姆的话我们就更不会知道了
None of us know the full story and we'll never learn anything babysitting these villagers.

149
00:10:09,365 --> 00:10:11,365
我们需要劝Jaune放手
We have to convince Jaune to let them go.

150
00:10:12,032 --> 00:10:12,698
要怎么做?
But how?

151
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:15,990
他明显有些神智不清
He's clearly not all there.

152
00:10:18,615 --> 00:10:19,532
你是这么想的吗?
Is that what you think?

153
00:10:24,782 --> 00:10:26,740
如果说猫说的是实话呢?
But what if the cat was telling the truth?

154
00:10:26,782 --> 00:10:27,823
可能不全都是实话
Maybe not about everything.

155
00:10:27,865 --> 00:10:28,740
但是关于树的事可能是真的
But about the tree.

156
00:10:28,782 --> 00:10:31,365
那棵树的事是你最不该听它胡说的!
The tree's the last thing you should listen to them about!

157
00:10:31,532 --> 00:10:34,157
它只是在完成它被赋予的任务
They're just doing what they're designed to do.

158
00:10:34,198 --> 00:10:35,907
他根本不在乎你到那去之后会怎样
They don't care what happens when you get there.

159
00:10:35,948 --> 00:10:37,573
我们没有在听它胡说
We're not listening to them.

160
00:10:37,948 --> 00:10:40,157
我们在听仙境居民们说的话
We're listening to the Afterans.

161
00:10:40,573 --> 00:10:43,990
他们告诉我们那棵树并不可怕
ng us that the tree is nothing

162
00:10:44,365 --> 00:10:46,032
而具 他们想要过去
That they want to go.

163
00:10:46,073 --> 00:10:47,782
他们不知道自己想要什么
They don't know what they want.

164
00:10:47,823 --> 00:10:49,407
你也看到了他们平时什么样
You've seen the way they act.

165
00:10:49,448 --> 00:10:52,240
这里的一切都没有那么简单 明白吗?
Nothing here is that straightforward, okay?

166
00:10:52,282 --> 00:10:57,615
仙境居民们要么太聪明 要么太蠢 要么太疯 哪一个都不能去信任
Afterans are all either too clever, too stupid, or too crazy to trust.

167
00:10:59,698 --> 00:11:01,865
那你又为什么那么在乎这个村子
Then why do you care so much about this village.

168
00:11:02,115 --> 00:11:04,990
因为在这里我真的可以保护这些人!
Because I can actually protect these people!

169
00:11:20,282 --> 00:11:21,073
它们找到我们了
They found us.

170
00:11:25,532 --> 00:11:27,157
我不会让他们失望的
I am not letting them down.

171
00:11:29,198 --> 00:11:33,365
如果那些伽卜沃克下来了 这些仙境居民就永远不能飞升了!
If those walkers make it down here, those Afterans will never ascend!

172
00:11:33,490 --> 00:11:35,365
这次我们不会逃走了
And we won't run this time.

173
00:11:52,823 --> 00:11:53,323
谢谢!
Thank you!

174
00:11:53,365 --> 00:11:54,282
集中注意力!
Stay focused!

175
00:12:41,323 --> 00:12:41,865
Jaune!
Jaune!

176
00:12:58,365 --> 00:12:58,948
错过
Missed.

177
00:12:59,407 --> 00:13:00,032
厌恶
Hate.

178
00:13:00,282 --> 00:13:00,823
思索
Thinking.

179
00:13:01,282 --> 00:13:01,823
等待
Wait.

180
00:13:02,115 --> 00:13:02,907
渴望
Wanting.

181
00:13:03,532 --> 00:13:04,282
垂涎
Drooling.

182
00:13:04,323 --> 00:13:06,282
渴求
Craving.

183
00:13:06,407 --> 00:13:07,282
美味
Tasty.

184
00:13:09,865 --> 00:13:10,657
Ruby!
Ruby!

185
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:13,823
渴望
Wanting.

186
00:13:17,865 --> 00:13:18,323
厌恶
Hate.

187
00:13:21,032 --> 00:13:21,698
正确
Yes.

188
00:13:22,073 --> 00:13:22,782
准备
Ready.

189
00:13:23,573 --> 00:13:24,657
饥饿
Starving.

190
00:13:25,157 --> 00:13:26,323
进食
Taking.

191
00:13:26,948 --> 00:13:27,573
Ruby!
Ruby!

192
00:13:55,407 --> 00:13:57,490
是集市上的那群伽卜沃克
The walkers from the market.

193
00:13:57,907 --> 00:14:01,782
但是这... 这跟她之前的小打小闹不同
But that's... Those were more than just her usual tricks.

194
00:14:01,948 --> 00:14:05,115
他们会进食 会变大 而且..
They eat and grow and...

195
00:14:05,573 --> 00:14:07,698
她怎么会变得这么强?
How has she gotten so powerful?

196
00:14:08,073 --> 00:14:10,365
必定不是杵在这什么都不做才变强的
Well, she didn't do it by standing around.

197
00:14:11,448 --> 00:14:13,782
我明白你不在乎村庄的事也不想保护它
I know you may not care about protecting this village.

198
00:14:14,282 --> 00:14:17,115
但是你至少可以在你朋友们遇到危险的时候出手相助
But you could at least help your friends when they are in danger...

199
00:14:20,740 --> 00:14:22,615
Ruby?你还好.
Ruby? Are you O-.

200
00:14:26,282 --> 00:14:28,448
不不不 现在什么时间了?不!
No no no, what time is it? No!

201
00:14:32,115 --> 00:14:34,073
不!
No!

202
00:14:36,282 --> 00:14:36,990
噢 Jaune...
Oh Jaune...

203
00:14:38,198 --> 00:14:42,073
我没能保护他们 我应该要保护好他们的 但是...
I couldn't save them, I was supposed to save them, and...

204
00:14:43,365 --> 00:14:44,198
他们死了
And they're dead.

205
00:14:47,532 --> 00:14:51,198
不Jaune 他们离开了但他们并没有死亡
No Jaune. They're gone. But they're not dead.

206
00:14:51,698 --> 00:14:51,990
他们会回来的
They'll be back.

207
00:14:52,782 --> 00:14:54,740
是啊 这也是他们想要的
Yeah. It's what they wanted.

208
00:14:55,532 --> 00:14:56,448
对吧 Ruby?
Right Ruby?

209
00:14:58,198 --> 00:14:59,573
你问我干什么?
Why are you asking me?

210
00:14:59,990 --> 00:15:01,740
呃 我们只是...
Umm, we just...

211
00:15:01,782 --> 00:15:02,823
因为我是队长?
Because I'm the leader?

212
00:15:04,407 --> 00:15:07,282
因为我就应该要说些什么?
Because I'm just supposed to have something to say?

213
00:15:08,198 --> 00:15:09,198
我没有想说的话
'Cause I don't.

214
00:15:10,615 --> 00:15:13,740
说真的 为什么非要是我当队长?
I mean, why do I have to be the leader anyway?

215
00:15:13,907 --> 00:15:18,240
为什么我要当那个每次都去救起其他人的角色?
Why do I have to always be the one to pick people up?

216
00:15:18,657 --> 00:15:19,823
那我怎么办?
What about me?

217
00:15:20,615 --> 00:15:22,115
没人有时间管我 对吗?
No time, right?

218
00:15:22,532 --> 00:15:24,948
要回家 要帮助Jaune
Gotta get home. Gotta help Jaune.

219
00:15:25,365 --> 00:15:29,282
要找到一个不会做错事情的靠谱的人
Gotta find someone who isn't just going to screw everything up.

220
00:15:29,948 --> 00:15:32,365
要保持乐观的心态 对吧?
Gotta stay positive. Right?

221
00:15:32,907 --> 00:15:34,698
大家都笑笑
Smiles all around.

222
00:15:35,198 --> 00:15:38,032
甚至终于能把我们的感情给整理清楚了
Maybe even finally get our feelings sorted out.

223
00:15:38,573 --> 00:15:42,782
说起来 你们真棒啊 大家都好为你们开心哦
Good for you, by the way, we're all so happy for you.

224
00:15:43,073 --> 00:15:43,448
喂...
Hey...

225
00:15:43,865 --> 00:15:45,698
不好意思 现在不是个好时候吗?
I'm sorry, is this a bad time?

226
00:15:45,990 --> 00:15:49,823
现在我们是该为Jaune假想的朋友们哀悼吗?
Are we supposed to be mourning Jaune's make-believe friends?

227
00:15:49,865 --> 00:15:52,573
因为你 他们才离开了!
They're gone because of you!

228
00:15:53,032 --> 00:15:54,948
伽卜沃克是来找你的!
The Walkers came for you!

229
00:15:55,032 --> 00:15:56,948
因为妮奥讨厌你!
Because Neo hates you!

230
00:15:57,323 --> 00:16:00,573
哦 别忘了我们最初为什么会掉到永恒仙境里
Oh let's not forget the reason we're in the Ever After in the first place.

231
00:16:00,698 --> 00:16:03,198
是因为你那没成功的计划!
It's because of your plan that didn't work!

232
00:16:03,240 --> 00:16:04,323
‘那你怎么办’?
What about you?

233
00:16:04,365 --> 00:16:06,032
这全都是因为你!
It's all about you!

234
00:16:08,948 --> 00:16:09,448
Jaune
Jaune

235
00:16:10,032 --> 00:16:11,157
抱歉 我...
I'm sorry I...

236
00:16:12,490 --> 00:16:13,782
我知道我状态不好
I know I'm not okay.

237
00:16:13,823 --> 00:16:15,198
我 我很不对劲 但是!
I'm... I'm not right, but...

238
00:16:16,115 --> 00:16:17,573
我怎么会好呢?
How am I supposed to be?

239
00:16:18,948 --> 00:16:22,865
那么久了 我一直是一个人!
I've been alone for SO LONG!

240
00:16:23,865 --> 00:16:26,782
在这 在这座桥上...
Here, on that bridge...

241
00:16:27,323 --> 00:16:30,615
我是唯一一个能拯救他们的 唯一一个!
I was the only one that could do it. I was the only one!

242
00:16:33,115 --> 00:16:38,448
而我... 而我要永远背负着这份痛苦
And I... And now I have to live with that forever.

243
00:16:41,907 --> 00:16:43,657
在这也是 回到家也是
In here or back home.

244
00:16:45,448 --> 00:16:47,948
各位 我知道情况很糟糕 但是
Guys, I know things are bad, but...

245
00:16:47,990 --> 00:16:49,490
闭嘴
Shut up.

246
00:16:51,573 --> 00:16:53,740
不要这样
Don't do that.

247
00:16:55,573 --> 00:16:56,365
不要这样
Just don't.